    },
    {
      "fact": "The proposed dates are ratified at a meeting between the local Joint Consultative Committee of unions and the local authority.",
      "source": "https://www.dudley.gov.uk/residents/learning-and-school/school-information/school-term-dates/"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The council plans term dates as much as four years ahead of the current year.",
      "source": "https://www.dudley.gov.uk/residents/learning-and-school/school-information/school-term-dates/"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The page gives a working day count per term: 74, 54 and 67 days in 2026-27, a total of 195, with inset days to be checked with each school.",
      "source": "https://www.dudley.gov.uk/residents/learning-and-school/school-information/school-term-dates/"
    },
    {
      "fact": "In 2027-28 the autumn term starts on Thursday 2 September 2027 and the Easter break is late, with the spring term ending on Friday 7 April 2028 and the summer term starting on Monday 24 April 2028.",
      "source": "https://www.dudley.gov.uk/residents/learning-and-school/school-information/school-term-dates/"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The page also lists a Primary Liaison Week in summer, for example Monday 29 June to Friday 3 July 2026.",
